# We use a registry to save and share the images
# CLoud based : Dockerhub, ECR(AWS), AZURE(ACR), GCR(GCP)
# Local : Nexus, JFROG, DTRs

to push the local image to dockerhub, the image name format should be:

dockerhub-username/repo-name:tag

| docker tag image1:html killadi98/statichtml-practice:v1 | command to change the image name |

| docker login | login to dockerhub |

| docker push killadi98/statichtml-practice:v1 | to push to dockerhub |

| docker pull killadi98/statichtml-practice:v1 | to pull from dockerhub |

| docker rmi image-name | to remove the images |







